    <title>Python 学习笔记（持续更新中）</title>
    <url>/2026/10/31/python_notes/</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<blockquote>
<p>本文笔记主要参考 <a href="https://space.bilibili.com/37974444"><strong>黑马程序员</strong></a> 的 <a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1qW4y1a7fU/">Python 入门教程</a> 整理，并在课程基础上补充了实际开发中的常见问题。持续更新，按章节顺序追加。</p>
</blockquote>
<h2 id="这份笔记怎么用">这份笔记怎么用</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>按章节顺序</strong>：从零开始，前后有依赖，建议顺着看</li>
<li><strong>代码都能直接跑</strong>：每段示例都是完整可运行的 Python 3 代码</li>
<li><strong>带「延伸」框</strong>：课程没讲、但实际会用到的内容单独标出，可以跳过，回头再看</li>
<li><strong>不写个人进度</strong>：这里只讲知识本身，适合当作复习资料或给初学者参考</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="一、Python-是什么">一、Python 是什么</h2>
<p>Python 是一门<strong>解释型、面向对象、动态类型</strong>的编程语言，特点是<strong>语法接近自然语言</strong>，入门门槛低，同时生态极强（数据分析、爬虫、Web、自动化、AI 都用它）。</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>特点</th>
<th>说明</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>解释执行</td>
<td>不用编译，写完直接运行</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>动态类型</td>
<td>变量不用声明类型，赋值时自动确定</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>缩进敏感</td>
<td>用<strong>缩进</strong>（4 个空格）表示代码块，不用大括号</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>生态丰富</td>
<td><code>pip install</code> 就能装十万+ 第三方库</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>为什么新手常被缩进绊到</strong>：Python 用缩进划分代码块，缩进错了程序直接报错 <code>IndentationError</code>，这在其他语言里很少见。</p>
</blockquote>
<h2 id="二、第一个程序和注释">二、第一个程序和注释</h2>
<figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;Hello, Python&quot;</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<p><strong>注释</strong>：写给人看的说明，程序执行时会被忽略。</p>
<figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 这是单行注释</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">&quot;&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">这是多行注释</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">可以写很多行</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">&quot;&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;你好&quot;</span>)  <span class="comment"># 行尾也可以写注释</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>原则</strong>：注释解释&quot;<strong>为什么这么写</strong>&quot;，而不是&quot;这行在做什么&quot;——<code>x = x + 1  # x 加 1</code> 这种注释是废话。</p>
</blockquote>
<h2 id="三、变量">三、变量</h2>
<p>变量就是给数据起个名字，方便后面反复使用。</p>
<figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">name = <span class="string">&quot;张三&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">age = <span class="number">20</span></span><br><span class="line">height = <span class="number">1.75</span></span><br><span class="line">is_student = <span class="literal">True</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(name, age, height, is_student)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<p><strong>命名规则</strong>（记这几条就够）：</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>规则</th>
<th>正确</th>
<th>错误</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>只能字母、数字、下划线</td>
<td><code>user_name</code></td>
<td><code>user-name</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>不能以数字开头</td>
<td><code>num1</code></td>
<td><code>1num</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>区分大小写</td>
<td><code>Age</code> 和 <code>age</code> 是两个变量</td>
<td>—</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>不能用关键字</td>
<td><code>my_class</code></td>
<td><code>class</code></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>约定</strong>：变量名用<strong>小写 + 下划线</strong>（<code>user_name</code>），常量用全大写（<code>MAX_SIZE</code>）。这不是语法要求，但团队协作里必须统一。</p>
</blockquote>
<p><strong>延伸：变量其实是什么</strong></p>
<p>Python 的变量不是&quot;装数据的盒子&quot;，而是<strong>贴在数据上的标签</strong>。<code>a = b = [1, 2]</code> 时，<code>a</code> 和 <code>b</code> 指向<strong>同一个列表</strong>，改一个另一个也变——这是新手最容易踩的坑之一。</p>
<h2 id="四、数据类型">四、数据类型</h2>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>类型</th>
<th>说明</th>
<th>示例</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>int</code></td>
<td>整数</td>
<td><code>100</code>、<code>-5</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>float</code></td>
<td>小数</td>
<td><code>3.14</code>、<code>2.0</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>str</code></td>
<td>字符串（引号包起来）</td>
<td><code>&quot;你好&quot;</code>、<code>'abc'</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>bool</code></td>
<td>布尔值</td>
<td><code>True</code>、<code>False</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>NoneType</code></td>
<td>空值</td>
<td><code>None</code></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p><strong>查看类型</strong>：</p>
<figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="built_in">type</span>(<span class="number">100</span>))       <span class="comment"># &lt;class &#x27;int&#x27;&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="built_in">type</span>(<span class="string">&quot;100&quot;</span>))     <span class="comment"># &lt;class &#x27;str&#x27;&gt;   ← 带引号就是字符串</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<blockquote>
<p><strong><code>&quot;100&quot;</code> 和 <code>100</code> 完全不同</strong>：前者是文字，不能做加减；后者是数字。这是新手报错的第一大来源。</p>
</blockquote>
<p><strong>类型转换</strong>：</p>
<figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">num_str = <span class="string">&quot;123&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">num = <span class="built_in">int</span>(num_str)      <span class="comment"># 字符串 → 整数</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(num + <span class="number">1</span>)          <span class="comment"># 124</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">price = <span class="built_in">float</span>(<span class="string">&quot;9.9&quot;</span>)    <span class="comment"># 字符串 → 小数</span></span><br><span class="line">text = <span class="built_in">str</span>(<span class="number">100</span>)         <span class="comment"># 数字 → 字符串</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>会失败的转换</strong>：<code>int(&quot;abc&quot;)</code> 会直接抛 <code>ValueError</code>。所以转换<strong>用户输入</strong>时一定要考虑它可能不是数字。</p>
</blockquote>
<h2 id="五、输入与输出">五、输入与输出</h2>
<p><strong>输出</strong> <code>print</code>：</p>
<figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;a&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&quot;b&quot;</span>)              <span class="comment"># a b        （默认空格分隔）</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;a&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&quot;b&quot;</span>, sep=<span class="string">&quot;-&quot;</span>)     <span class="comment"># a-b        （自定义分隔符）</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;第一行&quot;</span>, end=<span class="string">&quot;&quot;</span>)      <span class="comment"># 不换行</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;第二行&quot;</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<p><strong>输入</strong> <code>input</code>：</p>
<figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">name = <span class="built_in">input</span>(<span class="string">&quot;请输入你的名字：&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;你好，&quot;</span> + name)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>关键</strong>：<code>input()</code> 拿到的<strong>永远是字符串</strong>。想要数字必须自己转：</p>
<figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">age = <span class="built_in">int</span>(<span class="built_in">input</span>(<span class="string">&quot;请输入年龄：&quot;</span>))   <span class="comment"># 不转就是字符串，&quot;18&quot; + 1 会报错</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</blockquote>
<p><strong>格式化输出</strong>（三种写法，推荐第三种）：</p>
<figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">name, age = <span class="string">&quot;张三&quot;</span>, <span class="number">20</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;我叫&quot;</span> + name + <span class="string">&quot;，今年&quot;</span> + <span class="built_in">str</span>(age) + <span class="string">&quot;岁&quot;</span>)   <span class="comment"># 拼接，麻烦</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;我叫%s，今年%d岁&quot;</span> % (name, age))              <span class="comment"># % 占位符，老写法</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">f&quot;我叫<span class="subst">&#123;name&#125;</span>，今年<span class="subst">&#123;age&#125;</span>岁&quot;</span>)                    <span class="comment"># f-string，推荐</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>f-string</strong>（Python 3.6+）直接在大括号里写变量，还能算表达式：<code>f&quot;&#123;age + 1&#125; 岁&quot;</code>。可读性最好，新代码就用它。</p>
</blockquote>
<h2 id="六、运算符">六、运算符</h2>
<p><strong>算术运算</strong>：</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>运算符</th>
<th>说明</th>
<th>示例</th>
<th>结果</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>+</code> <code>-</code> <code>*</code></td>
<td>加减乘</td>
<td><code>3 * 4</code></td>
<td><code>12</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>/</code></td>
<td>除法（结果一定是小数）</td>
<td><code>7 / 2</code></td>
<td><code>3.5</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>//</code></td>
<td>整除（向下取整）</td>
<td><code>7 // 2</code></td>
<td><code>3</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>%</code></td>
<td>取余数</td>
<td><code>7 % 2</code></td>
<td><code>1</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>**</code></td>
<td>幂运算</td>
<td><code>2 ** 10</code></td>
<td><code>1024</code></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>注意</strong>：<code>/</code> 在 Python 3 里<strong>永远返回小数</strong>，<code>10 / 2</code> 是 <code>5.0</code> 不是 <code>5</code>。要整数用 <code>//</code>。</p>
</blockquote>
<p><strong>比较与逻辑</strong>：</p>
<figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="number">3</span> &gt; <span class="number">2</span>)          <span class="comment"># True</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="number">3</span> == <span class="number">3.0</span>)       <span class="comment"># True   值相等就算相等</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="keyword">not</span> <span class="literal">True</span>)       <span class="comment"># False</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="literal">True</span> <span class="keyword">and</span> <span class="literal">False</span>) <span class="comment"># False</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="literal">True</span> <span class="keyword">or</span> <span class="literal">False</span>)  <span class="comment"># True</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<h2 id="小结">小结</h2>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>知识点</th>
<th>记住一句话</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>注释</td>
<td><code>#</code> 单行，<code>&quot;&quot;&quot;</code> 多行，解释&quot;为什么&quot;</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>变量</td>
<td>标签不是盒子，命名用小写下划线</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>类型</td>
<td><code>&quot;100&quot;</code> 是文字，<code>100</code> 是数字</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>输入</td>
<td><code>input()</code> 永远返回字符串，要数字必须转</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>输出</td>
<td>优先用 <code>f&quot;&#123;变量&#125;&quot;</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>运算</td>
<td><code>/</code> 得小数，<code>//</code> 得整数</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<hr>
<p><strong>下一篇</strong>：条件判断与循环（<code>if</code> / <code>while</code> / <code>for</code>）。</p>
]]></content>
